     "object": "obj_eima_klal_uprat",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "אימא: וכסהו כלל, עפר פרט -- read as generalisation-and-detail, only earth is fit and nothing else",
     "against": "p_ribui_umiut_min_afar",
     "state": "answered"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_vechisahu_klal_uprat",
     "gloss_en": "say: 'and cover it' is a generalisation and 'earth' a detail; the generalisation holds only the detail -- earth yes, anything else no"
    }
   ]
  },
